A simple Python command-line application that allows users to search, add, update, and view programming terms and their definitions.

Features

✅ Search for programming terms

✅ Add new words and definitions

✅ Update existing definitions

✅ View all stored words and meanings

✅ User-friendly menu-driven interface

Technologies Used
Python 3
Dictionaries
Functions
Loops
Conditional Statements
String Manipulation
